{"title":"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 23","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" /> are both in the line segment <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> and on the same side of its midpoint. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> divides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> in the ratio <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/b/37bac8710233ca570649f0526e28b1a1ebb69d1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2:3$\" width=\"32\" height=\"12\" />, \nand <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" /> divides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> in the ratio <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/e/8aeed4747bc966b093ca8740cc9bd952cf39c891.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3:4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"33\" height=\"13\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/6/bd652fd6084b903bf7381a774ad7750c1c895b96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PQ=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"61\" height=\"16\" />, then the length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/6/6b679b10cdbf4dc5c3007bdb6d805bd15ba2a4b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 60\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 70\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 75\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 80\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 85$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"394\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/5/f85149cdc26ad6308c0c4e1e1c3c3a11206d5005.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((0,0)--(70,0)); dot((0,0)); dot((28,0)); dot((30,0)); dot((70,0)); label(&quot;2&quot;,(29,0),N); label(&quot;x&quot;,(14,0),N); label(&quot;y&quot;,(50,0),N); label(&quot;A&quot;,(0,0),S); label(&quot;P&quot;,(28,0),SW); label(&quot;Q&quot;,(30,0),SE); label(&quot;B&quot;,(70,0),S); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"48\" />\n</p><p>Draw diagram as shown, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" /> are on the same side.  Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/5/515ae1630862eae34166753e6841dfd120e9e644.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AP = x$\" width=\"62\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/1/b71cdf08d8e3ad1c7358eef2f793b7aae1d89f11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$QB = y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"62\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> divides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> in the ratio <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/b/37bac8710233ca570649f0526e28b1a1ebb69d1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2:3$\" width=\"32\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/c/cdcc867cabac0104653d615d5175b73c21f36bc2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x}{y+2} = \\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"80\" height=\"40\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" /> divides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> in the ratio <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/e/8aeed4747bc966b093ca8740cc9bd952cf39c891.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3:4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"33\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/9/bd9249493ed9165ec2a1d3eaa2c9967666855341.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x+2}{y} = \\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"81\" height=\"41\" />.  Cross multiply to get a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=System_of_equations\" title=\"System of equations\">system of equations</a>.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/4/3c4541293b44076605a0753e516be79b76f0903f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[3x = 2y+4\\]\" width=\"93\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/0/1e0bf96b8c1ee555a3ceec3b2380a66dc966deda.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[4x+8=3y\\]\" width=\"92\" height=\"16\" />\nSolve the system to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/3/b73c64f6b2d79cee4ae6ca58e30a71557dcc9611.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 28$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/d/85d42462dac538e794345e1c7b20a8ce78bcec2d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"16\" />.  Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/5/205ef274c1d3a30544a2a579f12d9ed1814cec6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB = 40 + 28 + 2 = 70$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"184\" height=\"14\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/1/a2194b81820e8380be586c1564c3f5d03d5c100d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME\" title=\"1961 AHSME\">1961 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1961 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1961\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">Problem 22</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">Problem 24</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 31\">31</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_32\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 32\">32</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_33\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 33\">33</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 34\">34</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 35\">35</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_36\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 36\">36</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_37\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 37\">37</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_38\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 38\">38</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 39\">39</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_40\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 40\">40</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017163514\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.044 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.065 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 281/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2984/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 196/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5679/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   14.835      1 -total\n 62.28%    9.239      1 Template:AHSME_40p_box\n 35.60%    5.282      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:16306:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017163514 and revision id 94760. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}